{
  "name": "join-code",
  "description": "Join code shown on both phones while someone asks to join (design D, invite flow): join_code_key = HKDF-Expand(invite_secret, \"pingers/v1/join-code\", 32); mac_input = be32(len(key_package)) || key_package || be32(len(x_wing_key_package)) || x_wing_key_package, where the X-Wing key package is empty (\"\") when the request carries none; mac = HMAC-SHA256(join_code_key, mac_input); code_value = be64(mac[0..8]) mod 10^16, shown as 16 digits in four groups of four, leading zeros kept. Both key packages are exactly as carried in the join request, so the code covers whichever one the inviter adds.",
